WEBVTT

00:06:29.676 --> 00:06:30.916
Which set of doors now?

00:06:30.956 --> 00:06:32.676
Left or right?

00:06:32.716 --> 00:06:34.796
I'm staggered.

00:06:34.836 --> 00:06:37.236
OK. Final example.

00:06:37.236 --> 00:06:40.916
Let's assume that you've actually gone in
through the doors on the right.

00:06:40.956 --> 00:06:43.516
You're coming out,
you want to come out the building,

00:06:43.556 --> 00:06:46.356
but you've actually got
boxes of files under both arms.

00:06:46.356 --> 00:06:48.156
Which of the doors would you go then?

00:06:48.876 --> 00:06:50.476
Yeah. Hmm.

00:06:50.516 --> 00:06:51.796
I'm really staggered.

00:06:51.836 --> 00:06:53.236
In pretty much every example

00:06:53.236 --> 00:06:55.356
pretty much everybody
raised your left hand.

00:06:55.356 --> 00:06:56.636
Why was this?

00:06:56.676 --> 00:07:00.476
After all, you’re free to choose
which door to use at each time.